  "\n<details class=\"content-section applied-detail\" data-teaching=\"\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-634\">Apply it: what does a polygraph measure?</summary>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-635\">A polygraph records changes such as heart rate, blood pressure, breathing and sweating. These can reflect sympathetic activity, but they do not directly show whether someone is lying.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-636\"><strong><button aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" class=\"bio-term\" data-bio-term=\"evidence\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-637\" type=\"button\">Evidence</button> check:</strong> a racing heart can have several causes. The measurement alone cannot explain why it increased.</p>\n</details>\n<div class=\"content-section\">\n<section class=\"video-support\" data-video=\"QY9NTVh-Awo\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-638\">Peripheral nervous system: explanation 1</h3>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-639\">As you watch: Identify what connects to the CNS and distinguish the sensory route from the motor route.</p>\n<div data-video-slot=\"\">\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-load-video=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-640\">Load video</button> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QY9NTVh-Awo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-641\">Watch on YouTube</a>\n<p class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-642\">Video not playing? Use the written explanation on this page.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"video-support\" data-video=\"jaWrMYChc5A\">\n<p class=\"muted\">Source video returned an access restriction at the latest link check (12 September 2026). Playback may be restricted; the written explanation remains available.</p>\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-643\">Peripheral nervous system: explanation 2</h3>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-644\">As you watch: Compare somatic control of skeletal muscle with autonomic control of internal effectors.</p>\n<div data-video-slot=\"\">\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-load-video=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-645\">Load video</button> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jaWrMYChc5A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-646\">Watch on YouTube</a>\n<p class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-647\">Video not playing? Use the written explanation on this page.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"video-support\" data-video=\"DPWEhl7gbu4\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-648\">Autonomic responses: recap</h3>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-649\">As you watch: Follow the contrasting effects on pupils, heart activity and digestion.</p>\n<div data-video-slot=\"\">\n</div>\n<button type=\"button\" data-load-video=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-650\">Load video</button> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DPWEhl7gbu4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-651\">Watch on YouTube</a>\n<p class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-652\">Video not playing? Use the written explanation on this page.</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l08-check-toggle\">Open chapter check: Peripheral control</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"check-pns\" data-activity-mode=\"paired\" data-required-check=\"\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-653\">Check: Peripheral control</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-654\">Chapter check \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-655\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"check-pns-mc\">\n<h3 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-656\">The two divisions of the autonomic nervous system are called the</h3>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-657\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-pns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51668_82707_A275462\" data-answer=\"\"> central nervous system (CNS) and the peripheral nervous system (PNS).</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-658\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-pns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51668_82707_A275463\" data-answer=\"\"> somatic nervous system and the skeletal nervous system</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-659\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-pns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51668_82707_A275464\" data-answer=\"\"> sympathetic nervous system and the parasympathetic nervous system.</label>\n<label class=\"choice\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-660\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"check-pns-mc\" value=\"QUES_51668_82707_A275465\" data-answer=\"\"> myelinated nervous system and the unmyelinated nervous system.</label>\n<button type=\"button\" data-check=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-661\">Check answer</button>\n<p data-feedback=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-662\">\n</p>\n<fieldset class=\"paired-writing\" data-unlock=\"check-pns-mc\" disabled=\"\">\n<legend>Explain the related idea</legend>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-663\">\nCompare the functions of the sympathetic and parasympathetic divisions of the autonomic system. Give specific examples of their physiological effects in the body.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-664\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-665\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"check-pns-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-666\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"check-pns-written\" data-writing=\"check-pns-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"check-pns-written-limit check-pns-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"check-pns-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-667\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-668\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"check-pns-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-669\">\n</p>\n</fieldset>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-670\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-671\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-672\">\n</p>\n</section>\n</details>\n<details class=\"activity-disclosure\">\n<summary data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-l08-practice-toggle\">Open optional source practice: Peripheral control</summary>\n<section class=\"activity\" data-activity=\"practice-pns\" data-activity-mode=\"writing\">\n<h2 data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-673\">Source practice: Peripheral control</h2>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-674\">Optional source practice \u00b7 Select Start when ready. The elapsed timer includes breaks; Submit and finish stops it. Redo preserves earlier attempts.</p>\n<div class=\"save-row\">\n<button type=\"button\" data-start=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-675\">Start</button>\n<output data-timer=\"\">Not started</output>\n</div>\n<fieldset data-run-body=\"\" disabled=\"\">\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-28\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-676\">\nWhat are the major structures involved in the somatic system? </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-677\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"37\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-678\">Textbook p. 396</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-28-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-679\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-28-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-28-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-28-written-limit source-checkpoint-28-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-28-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-680\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-681\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-28-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-682\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-29\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-683\">\nWhat role does the somatic system play in the functioning of the body? </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-684\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"37\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-685\">Textbook p. 396</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-29-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-686\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-29-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-29-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-29-written-limit source-checkpoint-29-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-29-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-687\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-688\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-29-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-689\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-30\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-690\">\nWhat type of motor neurons are involved in the autonomic nervous system? </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-691\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-692\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-30-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-693\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-30-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-30-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-30-written-limit source-checkpoint-30-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-30-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-694\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-695\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-30-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-696\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-31\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-697\">\nWhat generally triggers the sympathetic nervous system, and what are its effects on the body? </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-698\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-699\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-31-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-700\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-31-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-31-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-31-written-limit source-checkpoint-31-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-31-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-701\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-702\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-31-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-703\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-checkpoint-32\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-704\">\nWhat generally triggers the parasympathetic nervous system, and what are its effects on the body? </p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-705\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-706\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-checkpoint-32-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-707\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-checkpoint-32-written\" data-writing=\"source-checkpoint-32-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-checkpoint-32-written-limit source-checkpoint-32-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-checkpoint-32-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-708\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-709\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-checkpoint-32-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-710\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review113-q1\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-711\">\nCompare the general functions of the central nervous system with the functions of the peripheral nervous system.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-712\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-713\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review113-q1-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-714\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review113-q1-written\" data-writing=\"source-review113-q1-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review113-q1-written-limit source-review113-q1-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review113-q1-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-715\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-716\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review113-q1-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-717\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review113-q2\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-718\">\nIdentify which division of the peripheral nervous system is under voluntary control and which division is under involuntary control. Compare the functions of these two divisions.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-719\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-720\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review113-q2-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-721\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review113-q2-written\" data-writing=\"source-review113-q2-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review113-q2-written-limit source-review113-q2-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review113-q2-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-722\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-723\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review113-q2-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-724\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review113-q3\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-725\">\nImagine that you are hiking in the mountains one afternoon with friends. As you turn a corner, you come across a mother bear and her cubs standing in the middle of the trail.</p>\n<ol class=\"subquestions\" type=\"a\">\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-726\">Identify the specific division of the nervous system that is responsible for the body\u2019s response to this situation.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-727\">Describe at least six physiological responses you might have upon seeing the bears.</li>\n<li data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-728\">Indicate the division of the nervous system that is responsible for returning the body back to equilibrium after the event is over.</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-729\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-730\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review113-q3-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-731\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review113-q3-written\" data-writing=\"source-review113-q3-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review113-q3-written-limit source-review113-q3-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review113-q3-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-732\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-733\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review113-q3-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-734\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review113-q4\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-735\">\nUse word processing software to construct a three-column table. Use the following headings: Body structures, Sympathetic stimulation effect, and Parasympathetic stimulation effect. In the first column, list these structures: eyes, salivary glands, bronchioles, heart, liver, adrenal glands, kidneys, stomach, pancreas, intestines, and bladder. Then complete the rest of the table. ICT</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-736\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-737\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review113-q4-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-738\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review113-q4-written\" data-writing=\"source-review113-q4-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review113-q4-written-limit source-review113-q4-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review113-q4-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-739\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-740\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review113-q4-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-741\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" data-question=\"source-review113-q5\">\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-742\">\nCompare how stimulants and depressants affect the nervous system. Name a common stimulant.</p>\n<p data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-743\">\n<a href=\"#textbook-library\" data-book-page=\"40\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-744\">Textbook p. 399</a>\n</p>\n<label for=\"source-review113-q5-written\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-745\">Written response</label>\n<textarea id=\"source-review113-q5-written\" data-writing=\"source-review113-q5-written\" data-answer-limit=\"3200\" rows=\"6\" aria-describedby=\"source-review113-q5-written-limit source-review113-q5-written-status\"></textarea>\n<p id=\"source-review113-q5-written-limit\" class=\"muted\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-746\">Up to 3200 characters. Drafts can be longer, but must fit before submission. Writing is not automatically graded.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-writing=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-747\">Save written response</button>\n<p data-writing-status=\"\" id=\"source-review113-q5-written-status\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-748\">\n</p>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<button type=\"button\" data-submit-run=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-749\">Submit and finish</button> <button type=\"button\" data-redo=\"\" hidden=\"\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-750\">Redo activity</button>\n<p data-run-status=\"\" role=\"status\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-751\">\n</p>\n</section>\n</details>\n<div class=\"content-section\">\n<a href=\"#lesson-07\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-752\">Previous: Drugs at the synapse</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\"> \u00b7 </span><a href=\"#lesson-09\" data-canvas-helper-edit-key=\"p3-chapter-753\">Next: Central control</a>\n<p class=\"textbook-practice-lesson-link\"><a